# tartan's EDIT pages: Engine, Voices, Morph, Play, Play 2 (its volume and low cut). The count was 4, so SELECT
# stopped at Play and Play 2 was out of reach (pages.c group_n, 2026-11-27)
wait 300
knob 2 engine tartan
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Voices
turn SELECT 1
expect page Morph
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
